 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's a lot of people. Do you want keep it one night, or spread it over few days with one night each? Then think about the weather. August can get quite hot at night. Start in the middle of the week, and give people the option of morning or evening. Not necessarily, but think about the time involved. A big table needs cleaning off anyway. That's a nice touch. Do want to be the main attraction, or mix it up with some outings? People usually sleep in pairs, so think about pairs rather than whole families.",
